Pass = DONE + independent checker (uibench: the app's own verdict). Wall = jev_run's clock (first decision → end, initial navigation excluded, as upstream). Wall stats over passes; IQR = p25–p75 (the noise band). Phase ms = medians of per-run sums over all runs. Decisions count every decision asked (DONE/BLOCKED and stale ones too); tokens likewise on builds from hc2/jev (older builds summed only the steps taken). Stale % = stale decisions / decisions. Capped = settles that ran into their 400 ms cap (builds from hc2/jev say; — otherwise). Settle % = settle ms / wall. $/run and $/pass = what the router billed + Jev's own input tokens at an assumed $1 per million (AGENTBENCH_JEV_USD_PER_M; TypeSafe names no price).

